   "widgets_values": [
    "Fixed documentary news camera at the United Nations General Assembly podium. The statesman in the opening frame stays behind the lectern with both hands resting on it: he blinks naturally, glances down at his notes and back up, shifts his weight slightly, and his suit and red tie move almost imperceptibly in the hall's air conditioning. The uniformed guard in the background stays still. Cold blue stage lighting, slow gentle push-in over 5 seconds, photorealistic broadcast look.\n\nAudio: large hall room tone, faint distant murmur of the assembly, a soft rustle of paper as he glances at his notes. No speech, no music.",
